<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rochester Medical rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rochester Medical rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities International Inc said Wednesday it initiated coverage on Rochester Medical Corp with a buy rating and six-month price target of $22.</p>
<p>--It cited the company's extensive product line of continence care devices for men and women, its multi-faced distribution, automated manufacturing capabilities and experienced management.</p>
<p>--Vector Securities estimates Rochester Medical will post a loss of $0.70 per share in 1997.</p>
<p>-Rochester Medical was up 1/8 at 16-3/8.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
